      "text": "If using AC power, ensure: • Your system is connected to a working AC (mains) outlet. • You are using the Bose ® AC power supply shipped with your speaker or a Bose accessory charger designed for the speaker. If using battery power, the battery may be in protection mode or discharged. Connect to a working AC outlet to restore the battery to operational mode and charge the battery.\n• Ensure your speaker is discoverable (Bluetooth status indicator blinks blue).",
